      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ThreadLocal.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ThreadLocal</code></a> subclass that exposes a specified name\nas <a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a> result (allowing for introspection).",
